  quarantineExitLines:
  - Am I in trouble? I don't think I broke anything.
  - I'll be very quiet. I've been practicing.
  killExitLines:
  - "I didn't do anything wrong\u2026 I was just standing here\u2026"
  - "It's getting dark\u2026 can someone\u2026 tell my mom?"
